    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91660" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρι-άτη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ],
		ἡ</span> (<i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			1.248
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			6.54
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i>, who says, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυριάτη θηλυκῶς, οὐχὶ
			πυρίατος, οὐδὲ πυριατή ὀξυτόνως</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beestings curdled by heating over
