				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					142
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυῷ καὶ πυριάτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					710
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				74.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.694
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.248
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυριατόν</span>.</div>
